<titlePage type="main"><docTitle><titlePart type="main"><hi rendition="#g">Die</hi><lb/>
<hi rendition="#b">Weisheit des Brahmanen,</hi></titlePart><lb/>
<titlePart type="sub"><hi rendition="#b">ein Lehrgedicht in Bruch&#x017F;tücken.</hi></titlePart></docTitle><lb/>
<byline><hi rendition="#g">Von</hi><lb/>
<docAuthor><hi rendition="#g">Friedrich Rückert</hi>.</docAuthor></byline><lb/>
